title: 'collectives-westend: deny value-moving calls to the `NonTransfer` proxy'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `NonTransfer` on Collectives Westend denied only `Balances`. It now also denies `PolkadotXcm`,
    whose transfers move assets to another chain, and salary `payout_other` on the Fellowship,
    Ambassador and Secretary instances, which pays the member's salary to any account. `payout` to
    the member's own account stays allowed.

    `NonTransfer` is no longer a superset of `Fellowship`, `Ambassador` or `Secretary`, which admit
    `payout_other`.
crates:
- name: collectives-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
